cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Do Zero-Shot Time-Series Foundation Models Beat Simple Baselines for Battery SOH Prediction? A Three-Dataset Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark that evaluates five time-series foundation models
  (Chronos-Bolt, Chronos-T5, TimesFM 2.5, Moirai-1.0, Lag-Llama) in the
  zero-shot regime against four classical baselines on three public
  lithium-ion aging datasets (MIT-Stanford, NASA PCoE, CALCE UMD), with
  paired bootstrap confidence intervals, Wilcoxon signed-rank tests,
  multi-seed variance, start-point sensitivity and cross-dataset transfer.
